BAR Droid phone version of BAR's Awards (luaui/widgets/gui_awards.lua), the panel at a game's end: its Leave and Show
Graphs are words, pressed in a strip 5 under and 5 over them, about 27 high in all: upright on a phone about 1.5 mm for
a finger (dev phone, 2026-11-17, a skirmish ended upright). The press strips 22 under and over the words, the words and
their places as BAR has them. Applied by the engine (BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as LuaUI loads it; if a block
finds no place, BAR's own file runs.

@@@ find
			and (y > widgetY + mathFloor((50 - 5) * widgetScale))
			and (y < widgetY + mathFloor((50 + 17 + 5) * widgetScale))
		then
			if chobbyLoaded then
@@@ with
			-- BAR Droid (phone): a finger's strip, 22 under and over the words (BAR's 5: about 1.5 mm in all upright)
			and (y > widgetY + mathFloor((50 - 22) * widgetScale))
			and (y < widgetY + mathFloor((50 + 17 + 22) * widgetScale))
		then
			if chobbyLoaded then
@@@ end

